        "TileImage": "$($repository e1c8c0a5-a506-45b6-9567-7b6df50b8877).Image",
        "Description": "Two well-known charlatans that have long evaded prosecution have been tracked down to Dubai. Omar Al-Ghazali and Sebastian Sato are suspected illegal pasta smugglers, aside from the obvious other dealings revolving around oil and gold. This smuggling business has ruined the lives of the good people of Sapienza, and these are the people that are pulling the strings. It&apos;s up to Agent 47 to stop these scumbags, though he needs to make it look like an accident. This can&apos;t tie back to him.",
